          "text": "evidence: the GPU was saturated at its power limit (busy 100%, at 69 of 70 W, SM clock 1252 of 1590 MHz): server settings that run more at once cannot add throughput here; what can is less work per request (shorter prompts or answers, cached shared prompts), a smaller or quantized model, or a faster GPU",
